re engineer https://newsletter.pragmaticengineer....\n•⁠ How AI-assisted coding will change software engineering: hard truths https://newsletter.pragmaticengineer....\n•⁠ AI Engineering in the real world https://newsletter.pragmaticengineer....\n•⁠ The AI Engineering stack https://newsletter.pragmaticengineer....\n•⁠ How Claude Code is built https://newsletter.pragmaticengineer....\n\n—\nWhere to find Addy Osmani:\n• X: https://x.com/addyosmani\n• LinkedIn:   / addyosmani  \n• Website: https://addyosmani.com\n• Newsletter: https://addyo.substack.com/\n\n—\nIn this episode, we cover:\n(00:00) Intro\n(02:17) Vibe coding vs. AI-assisted engineering\n(06:07) How Addy uses AI tools\n(13:10) Addy’s learnings about applying AI for development\n(18:47) Addy’s favorite tools\n(22:15) The 70% Problem\n(28:15) Tactics for efficient LLM usage\n(32:58) How AI tools evolved\n(34:29) The case for keeping expectations low and control high\n(38:05) Autonomous agents and working with them\n(42:49) How the EM and PM role changes with AI\n(47:14) The rise of new roles and shifts in developer education\n(48:11) The importance of critical thinking when working with AI\n(54:08) LLMs as a tool for learning\n(1:03:50) Rapid questions\n\n—\nSee the transcript and other references from the episode at https://newsletter.pragmaticengineer....\n\n—\nProduction and marketing by https://penname.co/.","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":1032,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBUQ040EGAciEwjM0pemh7qXAxUUYfIAHfqwI-JIyJbC1cS0irl0ygEE43i42A==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUZZTVljRnhqY1pkc05oc0ljQUZNYXM4Y0xQSHxBSTVJdTV1WXpOMjdQcS1BVU5rRjAtTm1Lbm4xcnVJYkR3MXdIcjhaWEhSazNHRGtFZUNFckxIZl94QzgtZDlyRXl3ZGxGaTZZc2t0VENSaDlPX2owRUpkMExQaUtkR1NxNElI\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.statsig.com%2Fcustomers%2Fgraphite\u0026v=dHIppEqwi0g","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":